//RS //! Semantic ratchet for the maintained Jet corpus.
//RS //!
//RS //! This is deliberately a test-support adapter. It is not a compiler lint and
//RS //! it is never consulted for source outside the checked-in corpus manifest.
//RS //! The manifest owns classification and provenance; the AST pass owns the
//RS //! recurrence rules; the domain tests decide when to call this adapter.
